-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT License above covers the theme's own code, build scripts and the
ornaments drawn by those scripts. It does not cover the following material,
which is included under its own terms:

* Fonts embedded in theme.css: EB Garamond, Cinzel, Manufacturing Consent and
  a subset of Noto Serif SC. SIL Open Font License 1.1; see fonts/OFL.txt.

* Icons by Lorc from game-icons.net, licensed under Creative Commons
  Attribution 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/): batwing-emblem,
  quill, scroll-unfurled, semi-closed-eye, tied-scroll, candle-light, laurels,
  claw-slashes, crossed-bones, skull-crossed-bones, spider-web, open-book and
  stiletto. They have been recoloured, re-centred, mirrored or traced into
  new shapes for this theme.

* Skull artwork modified from a public-domain engraving distributed by
  Heritage Library (HTC Heritage Type), used under that library's licence.

* Tarot card and hollow skull icons modified from ICOOON MONO
  (https://icooon-mono.com/), used under its terms of use.

* The Night Lords emblem is a trademark of Games Workshop Ltd. It appears in
  this unofficial fan work and is not licensed under the MIT License.

* Paintings in demo-vault/Assets are in the public domain:
  Johan Christian Dahl, View of Dresden by Moonlight (1839), and
  Abraham-Louis-Rodolphe Ducros, Night Storm at Cefalu (c. 1800-1805),
  both via Wikimedia Commons.
